## 2. Files to Create: `frontend/lib/sarvam.ts`

**Implementation details:**
We will create this file to house `sarvamSTT()` and `sarvamTTS()`.

- `sarvamSTT(audioBlob, languageCode)`: Maps user language preference to Sarvam codes (`hi-IN`, `ta-IN`), posts `FormData` to `https://api.sarvam.ai/speech-to-text`, returns transcript. Includes an 8-second timeout.
- `sarvamTTS(text, languageCode)`: Posts JSON to `https://api.sarvam.ai/text-to-speech`, decodes the returned `base64` audio string into an `AudioBuffer`, and plays it via the `AudioContext` Web API. Includes an 8-second timeout. Fails gracefully if the browser blocks autoplay.

