## 4. End-to-End Wiring

`Microphone Press` → `MediaRecorder` buffers WebM audio → `Microphone Release` → `sarvamSTT(blob)` → Transcript received → `setInputText(transcript)` → `handleSendMessage()` triggers Agent Flow → UI Updates → Agent Response Generated → `sarvamTTS(response.text)` → `AudioContext` plays `.wav` output → Merchant hears response.

