## 7. Fallback Behaviors

| Scenario | Fallback Behavior Implemented |
|---|---|
| Mic Permission Denied | Show specific error in chat, hide mic button or disable it. |
| STT Fails/Timeout | Clear loading state, show "Voice unavailable. Please type." in chat bubble. Text input remains active. |
| TTS Fails/Timeout | Silent fallback. Text bubble is already rendered. Catch error and `console.error` it. |
| Browser lacks Web Audio | Silent fallback for TTS. Browser lacks `MediaRecorder` → Mic button disabled on load. |

